    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/extras/062bda0bf39bbf6c96fe460ead68bbde.poster.avif?t=1755628265\" width=800 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/extras/062bda0bf39bbf6c96fe460ead68bbde.webm?t=1755628265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/extras/062bda0bf39bbf6c96fe460ead68bbde.mp4?t=1755628265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live through a chilling 1989 case inspired by real events, taking on <strong>multiple roles</strong> to uncover the truth through gathering clues, interviews, and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core loop revolves around investigation and <strong>solving the mystery</strong> by building a narrative on a corkboard, fueled by <strong>paranoia</strong>, <strong>hallucinations</strong>, and <strong>unreliable memories</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With just <strong>3 hours</strong> before the game self-destructs, players face rising tension, shifting perspectives, and questions that may never be fully answered.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/extras/c0d9599b8925168813f39983cae3e0cf.poster.avif?t=1755628265\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/extras/c0d9599b8925168813f39983cae3e0cf.webm?t=1755628265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/extras/c0d9599b8925168813f39983cae3e0cf.mp4?t=1755628265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>N<strong>arrative:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u201cWe didn\u2019t build the sign.\u201d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those five words changed everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a storm hits northern Japan, two missing hikers are found alive beside a massive SOS sign carved into the earth. But what happens next is where the story begins.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOS Incident</strong> is a narrative-driven psychological horror game inspired by a real unsolved case brought to life through Nexpo\u2019s original narration. You won\u2019t just watch the mystery unfold \u2014 <strong>you\u2019ll live it.</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/extras/062bda0bf39bbf6c96fe460ead68bbde.poster.avif?t=1755628265\" width=800 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/extras/062bda0bf39bbf6c96fe460ead68bbde.webm?t=1755628265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/extras/062bda0bf39bbf6c96fe460ead68bbde.mp4?t=1755628265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live through a chilling 1989 case inspired by real events, taking on <strong>multiple roles</strong> to uncover the truth through gathering clues, interviews, and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core loop revolves around investigation and <strong>solving the mystery</strong> by building a narrative on a corkboard, fueled by <strong>paranoia</strong>, <strong>hallucinations</strong>, and <strong>unreliable memories</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With just <strong>3 hours</strong> before the game self-destructs, players face rising tension, shifting perspectives, and questions that may never be fully answered.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/extras/c0d9599b8925168813f39983cae3e0cf.poster.avif?t=1755628265\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/extras/c0d9599b8925168813f39983cae3e0cf.webm?t=1755628265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702550/extras/c0d9599b8925168813f39983cae3e0cf.mp4?t=1755628265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>N<strong>arrative:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u201cWe didn\u2019t build the sign.\u201d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those five words changed everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a storm hits northern Japan, two missing hikers are found alive beside a massive SOS sign carved into the earth. But what happens next is where the story begins.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOS Incident</strong> is a narrative-driven psychological horror game inspired by a real unsolved case brought to life through Nexpo\u2019s original narration. You won\u2019t just watch the mystery unfold \u2014 <strong>you\u2019ll live it.</strong></p></li></ul>",
